## Slash commands (slash.rs): Mattermost's own commands, in its words

slash-away = Set your status to away
slash-code = Display text as a code block
slash-collapse = Collapse link previews
slash-dnd = Do not disturb: no desktop or push notifications
slash-echo = Echo back text from your account
slash-expand = Expand link previews
slash-groupmsg = Send a group message
slash-header = Edit the channel header
slash-help = Open the Mattermost help page
slash-invite = Invite a user to a channel
slash-join = Join a channel
slash-kick = Remove a member from the channel
slash-leave = Leave the current channel
slash-logout = Sign out of this server
slash-me = Do an action
slash-msg = Send a direct message
slash-mute = Mute the current channel or the one named
slash-offline = Set your status to offline
slash-online = Set your status to online
slash-purpose = Edit the channel purpose
slash-remove = Remove a member from the channel
slash-rename = Rename the channel
slash-search = Search messages
slash-settings = Open preferences
slash-shortcuts = Show keyboard shortcuts
slash-shrug = Add ¯\_(ツ)_/¯ to your message
